1
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:24,500
I tap the metal of the microphone,

2
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:32,799
The laughter dies across the parquet stone.

3
00:00:34,337 --> 00:00:41,637
They freeze their feet, they turn their eyes to me,

4
00:00:43,399 --> 00:00:50,501
And wait to hear what my words will be.

5
00:00:51,141 --> 00:00:58,647
A silent hall, the chandeliers hang cold,

6
00:00:59,086 --> 00:01:06,086
A bitter truth that never should be told.

7
00:01:07,133 --> 00:01:14,633
No trembling breath, my head is lifted high:

8
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:24,515
I speak her name and watch the music die.

9
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:50,625
The dance moves on, it answers to no prayer,

10
00:01:51,299 --> 00:01:58,500
It leaves the dead and broken in the air.

11
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:06,700
I pour my tea and watch them pass me by,

12
00:02:07,419 --> 00:02:17,414
Too proud to break, too resolute to cry.

13
00:02:19,078 --> 00:02:27,469
too resolute to cry.

14
00:02:28,188 --> 00:02:34,488
I watch the music die.

